## Unresponsive script dialog

dom-slow-script-dialog-title = Òstrzéga: Skript ni òdpòwiôdô
dom-slow-script-dialog-message = Skript na ti stronie mòże prawie robic abò òprzestôł òdpòwiadac, Mòże zatrzëmac skript terô abò jic dali, abë sprôwdzëc czë jegò robòta sã zakùńczi.
# Variables:
#   $location (String) - URL of the script, followed by a colon and the line number (e.g. “https://example.com/script.js:42”). Long URLs are shortened with an ellipsis in the middle.
dom-slow-script-dialog-location = Skript: { $location }
# The & character marks the access key of the checkbox label.
dom-slow-script-dialog-dont-ask-again = Ju wicy nie sã pëtôj
dom-slow-script-dialog-stop-button = Zatrzëmôj skript
dom-slow-script-dialog-continue-button = Biéj dali
